tasks.prompt:
Create these sequences:

CREATE SEQUENCE student_seq START WITH 1001 INCREMENT BY 1 NOCACHE NOCYCLE;
CREATE SEQUENCE enroll_seq START WITH 5001 INCREMENT BY 1 NOCACHE NOCYCLE;

Create an index on Enrollment(student_id) and show EXPLAIN PLAN for:
SELECT * FROM enrollment WHERE student_id = 1001;
Then drop the index and show EXPLAIN PLAN again. Summarize the difference.
